{"server":"en","storyId":"act17d0_level_act17d0_07_end","groupId":"act17d0","stageId":"act17d0_07","title":"Bunker Defense Line","storyCode":"OD-7","avgTag":"After Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_07_end.txt","sourceHash":"3f1064983499af45c607d63d0da2d6396faf157067be1ce3cebe2bb6f9eeb8b6","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"The onslaught of mutants challenges the operators defending the Lord's Manor. Operator Tachanka resolves to defend the others so that they may find shelter, standing alone against the swarm.","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_nobleD"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Away with you!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"This is endless!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"How many of these *profanity* things did they make?!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rangers","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"Liskarm! Look out behind you!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Originiutant","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Gaa..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"! !"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Watch out!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Franka!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"What are you doing?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Give me a hand, Miss Lord!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh, okay!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You... run!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't speak!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"My leg...You... just leave me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Cut the bullshit!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Piggyback, quick!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Picale","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"They're coming back!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"Now! Get out of here!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Occphen","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"Over here!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mr. Occphen! What are you doing here?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Occphen","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"How could I just wait around down there? I'm a Rhodes Island Operator too!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Damn straight! You really saved us!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rangers","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"Get ready to blow the engine..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rangers","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"Three, two, one..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"What's the situation?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rangers","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"They've been pushed back, for now. But they'll come for us again before long."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"There... seems to be less of them?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm all out of 'welcome mats.' Ammo's gone too."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"What's the plan, Alexsandr?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"Get to the shelter."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"What?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"Get to the shelter! Take the Rhodes Island Operators and get to shelter!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"What about you?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll cover you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"Cover? And who's covering you?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"I don't need cover."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"Hey! Get it together! Alexsandr!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm all together."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm tired of all the hiding and running."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"Running can't win you the war. History's shown."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"But this isn't a war."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"It is to me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"When they pull weapons on the Infected and try to kill my friends, it's a war."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"I've been through plenty of wars in my time."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"If I can kill even one more *profanity* monster here, it'll give the townsfolk a better shot at survival."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll make my stand here until I run out of ammo. Until the very end."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"The battle's not over. How could I retreat?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"You're the one who says not to play hero!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"I don't think I'm playing hero, Tina."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm just doing the right thing."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"No matter what happens, the show ends here, today."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"Alexsandr! !"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rangers","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm staying too."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"But why...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rangers","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"It was always going to turn out like this. We all knew it, from the moment you decided to stay and fight."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rangers","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll stay behind and help the warrior hold them back. And if things go bad, I'll cover his retreat."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"Mr. Rangers..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"Alexsandr, take this."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"What's this?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"An Originium bomb I tried my hand at making. There's only two left."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"...Thanks."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"Stay alive!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"...No promises."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"You didn't tell her the truth. You're not going to run."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rangers","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"Hahaha... You didn't have to go blowing this old man's scheme."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rangers","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"You need someone to hold these monsters back."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"This is...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rangers","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"The old Lord's blade. I borrowed it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rangers","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"This is a fine blade. The old Lord had good taste."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rangers","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"Beautifully decorated steel, and a hand-lain turquoise handle that's as nice as any modern industrially-manufactured weapon."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rangers","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"It's a lot safer to stand in the back with a bow and arrow than fighting on the front line."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rangers","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm so much older and slower than I was."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"But the blade, she's as sharp as ever."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rangers","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"I still don't know your name, warrior."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"Alexsandr Senaviev."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"You can call me Alexsandr."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rangers","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"I should tell you my name too."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Rangers","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"But the sands buried my name the day we stained the valley red with blood, along with the past."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"It's fine."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"You decided to stay and fight. That's what matters."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"'Rangers'."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"'They told me I'd died. They were wrong. I was reborn. '"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"No matter how many of those monsters there are."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Tachanka","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"Let them come."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","aliases":["Frost"]},{"speakerId":"char_459_tachak","aliases":["Tachanka"]},{"speakerId":"char_503_rang","aliases":["Rangers"]}]}
